WEBVTT

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.000
Acht!

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:26.700
Acht!

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.250
Griffith, can you do something about it?

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.000
My voice is about to die.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:44.450
Well, there's no other entertainment here.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.660
That doesn't mean I have to read
the same book over and over--

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.000
A new book did just arrive.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:55.160
It was originally Tania's job
to read Ilie books.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.200
I'll take over when I have time.

00:00:58.750 --> 00:00:59.750
So, please, Acht.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:03.830
What about him?

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.660
Isn't it usually the parent's job
to look after the child?

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:12.160
Regarding that, I feel the same way.

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:14.580
I'll talk to Franz about it.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.250
What's that one?

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:17.660
This book?

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.580
Well, it's not a very enjoyable story.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:26.910
"Wishing to become human,

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.870
a sea monster sells its own voice
to obtain human legs

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.080
and tries to get close to people
despite being unable to speak."

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:36.080
I see. That's creepy.

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:43.120
Why isn't she coming?

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.120
Let me go!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.620
-I just need a sample of your blood!
-Stop it!

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:51.370
-Mom, help me!
-Stay quiet!

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:56.370
You little failure!

00:01:58.790 --> 00:01:59.620
Acht!

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:03.750
What are you doing?!

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:06.080
What am I doing? This monster...

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:08.700
All right, I'll take care of the rest.

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:10.700
Damn it...

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:19.750
Acht, are you hurt?

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.370
-Let me see it.
-I'm not hurt.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.370
You don't need to look.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:26.870
Is that so...

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:31.040
<i>"The monster who couldn't become human</i>

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:33.370
was left with two choices.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.910
One, to throw itself into the sea

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.410
and dissolve into sea foam.

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:38.870
The other,

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:41.870
to thrust a knife into a human's stomach

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.790
and return as a sea monster."

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:45.540
Ilie?

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:48.040
What happened to the mermaid princess?

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.040
<i>It's...</i>

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:00.790
<i>still thinking of...</i>

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.250
<i>what to do right now.</i>

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.580
We're not gonna let you go!

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.660
Hold them off as much as you can.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:13.620
Oh, weren't you with everyone else?

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.450
I got separated...

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.290
Hadi, will reinforcements really come?

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:22.330
Who knows?

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:26.500
Let's leave our fate to the heavens,
and do what we can right now.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:30.000
Courage is something you show
while you're still alive.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.450
The remaining forces
are continuing to resist!

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:36.950
<i>I don't care. Crush them and move forward!</i>

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.500
<i>Take the control tower!</i>

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:40.750
They'll be here soon.

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.500
Hurry with the barricade!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.500
I will now head to the frontline as well.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.750
-And the civilian evacuation?
-It's taken care of.

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:59.750
Then tell our warriors this,

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:04.660
"The time of our death
will be the death of E-05.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:06.700
Our fate...

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.540
is one with this control tower."

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:19.620
Only 20 years since we changed
this city's name to E-05.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:25.290
Our ancestors are gonna kill us
on the other side once more.

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:27.500
Before it became E-05,

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:29.540
what was this place called?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:36.910
<i>Fire detected on 6th, 29th,</i>
<i>and 34th floors of the main tower.</i>

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.540
<i>Firewalls will be sealed. Commencing</i>
<i>emergency extinguishing procedures--</i>

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.700
<i>Wait! We haven't evacuated yet!</i>

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.540
<i>Please open up!</i>

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:54.080
<i>This is the main tower.</i>

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.370
<i>The girl and the Exterminator</i>
<i>have been spotted.</i>

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.660
<i>They seem to be heading up</i>
<i>from the west stairs.</i>

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:01.660
Got it. Keep following them.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:02.870
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:04.500
So, they were alive...

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:07.330
They seem to be headed
for the throne as well.

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:09.790
At this rate, the queen's body
will be in danger.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.370
You guys are crazy!

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.330
You still want to head to the throne
 in this situation?

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.410
I... I don't wanna die!

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.080
Whether you enter or exit,
you must go through the insect cage.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:27.370
Therefore, staying with us...

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:30.370
should be your best chance
of survival unless...

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:34.080
You know of a different route, don't you?

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:38.080
You are going to guide us, then.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:47.410
There's too many.
Maybe we should take a detour.

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:50.040
I'll make them listen to me.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.620
Aren't they going wild
because of your dad?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.160
They aren't going wild.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:02.450
To be exact, they're being forced to eat
by my mother's command.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.620
To keep eating even if they have to vomit?

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.540
Yes, to "consume all."

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:11.160
But...

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:14.000
I have the queen's power, like my mother.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:18.330
The whole room might be impossible,
but if I can get closer to the bugs...

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:21.500
Okay.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.790
I'm counting on you, princess.

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.250
Do you know who I am?

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:58.620
Stand back and bow down.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.080
Stop! Stop it!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:34.620
Idiot, run!

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:42.540
Here's a little something
I picked up for you!

00:09:57.750 --> 00:10:00.120
What were you saying
about the power of the queen?

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.580
You big show-off.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.410
Your servants won't listen to you at all.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.750
I told you the whole room wasn't possible.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.950
The command from the throne
is too powerful.

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:18.660
If I could take over from here,
there would be no need to go up.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:20.700
This is dry.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:24.660
You want me to get you some bug piss?

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.790
Pi-- You're disgusting!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:32.750
On the way here,

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:35.580
I passed through a place that was
like a Cagaster cemetery.

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:36.500
Cemetery?

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:38.540
<i>It was as if...</i>

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.080
<i>they went there to die...</i>

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.700
I don't think Cagasters
have their own will.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:50.040
I think they just work to maintain
the life of the insect cage.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.910
Maybe like the organs of a person.

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:59.080
They didn't look that drone-like to me.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:06.000
Hey! Who cares about that?!

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:08.790
These are the results
of Chilio's research!

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.450
With this, we have a place to go

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:12.950
whether it's the Allied Forces HQ
or an underground organization!

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.790
Adham and Chilio are both mad!

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.700
We're not sticking around any longer
to die with them!

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:23.620
Where do you think you're going,

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.790
leaving my brothers behind?

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:27.580
Brothers?

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.790
Oh, you mean these failures?

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.500
They're completely useless.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.160
Just keeping them alive
is a waste of money.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.660
You're the only one who came into shape.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:39.870
How about it, Acht?

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:42.330
There's no future staying here.

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:46.330
If you come with us,
you can live as a valuable sample.

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:47.500
That's true...

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:55.250
Completely worthless.

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:00.500
We, who couldn't replace Tania, and you,

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:03.700
who could only create worthless failures!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.500
You monster!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:14.410
Kidow!

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.250
Above us!

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:22.750
Kidow!

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.410
Keep your head down!

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:34.450
Soldiers in the narrow pathways
where bugs can't get in...

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.410
Bugs to greet you when you go outside.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:39.120
Feels like I'm back in the Far East.

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:45.450
What's the matter?

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:54.830
I said that I'd become your sword.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.870
Don't get upset just because
it's a little chipped!

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.120
If my master's like that,
I can't cut anything!

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.830
Stupid bastard, in a place like this...

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:19.080
Kidow?

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:21.580
Kidow!

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:23.330
Stay back.

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:33.080
<i>Fire detected at boiler No. 3.</i>

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:37.250
<i>Firewalls will be sealed. Commencing</i>
<i>emergency extinguishing procedures.</i>

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:43.040
Let's go.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:58.250
What's this place?

00:13:59.040 --> 00:13:59.870
This must be...

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.750
the emergency passage that Griffith
used when he took me away ten years ago.

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:04.790
Emergency passage?

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:09.870
I think the lab workers built it
in case of an emergency.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.370
So, they're not exactly a solid group.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.750
I think it's a shortcut to the throne.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.080
But now that it's been ten years,

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.950
I don't know if Adham is aware of it.

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:25.080
It's better than blindly moving about.

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:27.500
Let's go.

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:45.950
I see.

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:50.870
It sure doesn't look like
humans are using it.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:54.950
Let me.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.200
If you're an Exterminator,
this kind of stuff happens every day.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:05.830
You just think about
heading to the throne.

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:21.540
If we climb this all the way up,

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:24.250
we can reach the top floor
where the throne is?

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.330
-Yes...
-We appreciate your guidance.

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:30.620
I wish you luck, Your Excellency.

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:42.750
Let's go!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.290
The Exterminator of the Far East, eh?

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:52.250
Were you sent by
the Allied Forces Headquarters?

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:53.540
So what if I was?

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:58.500
Is there something you don't want
the headquarters to know?

00:15:58.620 --> 00:15:59.790
If I'm not mistaken,

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:02.200
you were the almighty
Inspector-General of 01.

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.410
Am I right, master of the insect cage?

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:05.450
You...!

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:09.830
We cannot let someone who knows
the truth of 07 escape alive.

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:11.450
Ilie.

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:14.370
We're gonna run to the back stairs
when we get the chance.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.500
Be ready.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.830
What happened to this girl's dad?

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:23.080
Franz Chilio made the throne his own

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.580
and tried to feed us to the bugs.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.500
Therefore, we finished him.

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:33.370
This horrifying sight
is because of your father.

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:38.000
His daughter has nothing to do with this!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:41.080
Exterminator of the Far East,

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:44.830
you entered this insect cage alone,
and yet here you are, alive.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:47.250
For that, you have my respect.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.580
However, that girl is a bug.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:54.580
That is too much
for a mere Exterminator's hands.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.870
At any place, at any given time,

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.790
that princess of bugs
can create another Far East.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:02.250
But if we can use it well,

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:06.910
we can weed out the bugs,
and create a world of only humans.

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:08.000
Child,

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:11.000
become the queen of this new paradise!

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:13.040
Not interested!

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:15.830
What's a paradise with bugs weeded out?

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.000
You must have meant hell.

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.950
Have you got something crawling
in your brain?

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:22.370
Seize him.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.870
-Go on ahead.
-What?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.290
I'll stay and buy time.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.580
I'll catch up later, so you...

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:55.660
Sorry, my left arm's getting pretty numb.

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:59.250
I don't think I can fight
while protecting you.

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:04.250
This is where my knighthood ends.

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:05.620
No...

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:09.160
Your mom's waiting above, right?

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:16.660
This was for you.

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:19.790
Your friend says...

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.620
that you guys are friends
no matter what happens.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.660
I made sure to give it to you...

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:29.500
so keep it safe.

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:36.500
Ilie,

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:39.700
sorry for hitting you when we first met.

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:43.450
If I could go back to when we met...

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.250
I would take you by your hand.

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:50.790
<i>Let's go together.</i>

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:52.330
I'm an Exterminator, but...

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:56.500
to be honest,
I can't help feeling afraid...

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:58.910
of living life alone.

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.830
That's why I want you to be with me.

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.000
I'll go with you.

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:15.700
So, please... don't die.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.120
For His Excellency

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:10.370
-and the future of mankind!
-Damn it!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:09.450
Tania...

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.040
I don't think I can make it that far.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:13.910
Sorry...

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:17.450
I wanted to be with you in the end.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:25.620
Mom! Mom, open up!

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:29.580
It's Ilie! I came to see you!

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:41.330
What is she doing?

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:48.870
<i>Continue forward.</i>

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:52.410
<i>The doors to the throne</i>
<i>have all been unlocked.</i>

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.160
Franz, you were alive?

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:58.290
If they had been just a little more
thoughtful and aimed for my heart,

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:00.290
this would've been a lot easier.

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:01.910
I won't last for long.

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:06.290
If you want to see Tania, hurry.

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:54.330
Hey.

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:03.290
Thanks for the invite...

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:06.450
Mr. Specimen No. 8.
